  m_Name: SSO_Log_Raj_First
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Header: To all subsequent Saviors!
  Body: "To all subsequent Saviors!\r\n\r\nIf you\u2019re reading this, then I\u2019ve
    most likely failed to reach the bottom. (Knowing my capabilities I was probably
    SO close\u2026)\r\n\r\nThanks to the Tower\u2019s divine powers, you have the
    knowledge of our previous attempts. With that in mind, you better be the one
    to reach the bottom and save our people! (\u2190 No pressure !)\n\nRajanii"
  IsDiscovered: 1
